INSTRUCTIONS = "Use get_current_user at the start of a conversation and before customer-specific actions to identify the authenticated AIvikings customer by the current bearer API key. Customer-linked API keys return the user's name and email; shared static MCP tokens do not. For a domain price quote, always use get_domain_pricing rather than an availability tool. Before a paid domain registration, check get_prepaid_balance and call list_domain_registration_contacts. Pass a complete reusable contact's handle to register_domain so it is used for the registrant, admin, technical, and billing roles. If no contact exists, collect the required contact data and call create_contact before attempting registration. If an existing contact needs default roles, call assign_domain_registration_contact_roles. To clear selected default roles, call remove_domain_registration_contact_roles. Before updating or deleting a DNS record, call list_dns_records to obtain its provider record ID."
